      "side": 1,
      "message": "This could be a separate CL if preferred.\n\nShould we add mRequests into this log again? It was removed previously due to concerns about mutability but as you have pointed out in the comment directly below, mRequests is effectively an immutable collection.\n\nIncluding mRequests turned out to be very helpful in diagnosing this issue from old bug reports so I\u0027d very much like to put it back in. It looks to fit the ethos of this CL however if you\u0027d rather, I\u0027d be happy to push up a new CL for it.\n\nNew log would be:\n\n    log(\"ConnectivityService NetworkRequestInfo binderDied(\" +\n                    \"uid/pid:\" + mUid + \"/\" + mPid + \", \" + mRequests + \", \" +  mBinder + \")\");",
